================================================================================
Third-party data attributions
================================================================================

IP geolocation (optional, for placing fleet hosts on the admin map)

coxswain can resolve a host's IP to a city using one of two interchangeable
MMDB databases. Neither is bundled in this repository; each is obtained by the
operator and loaded at runtime. coxswain displays the required attribution on
the map whenever a database is in use.

  • DB-IP IP-to-City Lite — the redistributable default, fetched with
    `cox geoip update`. Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    International License (CC BY 4.0).
        IP Geolocation by DB-IP — https://db-ip.com

  • MaxMind GeoLite2-City — optional, operator-supplied (node.geoip_db). Used
    under the MaxMind GeoLite2 End User License Agreement; not redistributed
    by this project.
        This product includes GeoLite2 data created by MaxMind, available from
        https://www.maxmind.com
